          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/projects/zhanjiang-logistics-port/" class="project-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
          <div class="project-img" style="background-image: url('/images/projects/zhanjiang-logistics-port-aerial-rendering.jpg');"></div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <span class="project-type">Large-Span Warehouse</span>
            <h3>Zhanjiang Logistics Port</h3>
            <div class="project-meta">
              <span>📍 Zhanjiang, China</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-scope">Large-span warehouse steel structures demonstrating wide-span framing, enclosure systems and fast erection capability.</p>
          </div>
        </a>
        <a href="/en/projects/shantou-luxshare-electronics-center/" class="project-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
          <div class="project-img" style="background-image: url('/images/projects/shantou-luxshare-precision-electronics-aerial-rendering.jpg');"></div>
          <div class="project-body">
            <span class="project-type">Industrial Park</span>
            <h3>Luxshare Precision Electronics Center</h3>
            <div class="project-meta">
              <span>📍 Shantou, China</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-scope">Multi-building industrial park with large-span steel structures, insulated enclosure systems and coordinated ventilation design.</p>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 20px; color: #888; font-size: 0.85rem; text-align: center; font-style: italic;">Note: Projects listed above are industrial and commercial steel structure projects demonstrating ZhongSai's large-span fabrication, corrosion protection and prefabricated export capabilities. These capabilities are directly applicable to agricultural and livestock building projects. Dedicated agricultural project references can be provided upon request.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;">
        <a href="/en/projects/" class="btn btn-outline">View All Projects</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Service Boundary -->
  <section class="detail-section dark">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading reveal" style="text-align: center;">
        <p class="section-index" style="justify-content: center;">Service Boundary</p>
        <h2 style="color: #fff;">What ZhongSai Provides and Does Not Provide</h2>
        <p style="margin: 0 auto;">Clear service scope for agricultural and livestock building projects.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="geo-boundary">
        <div class="geo-box include">
          <h4>ZhongSai Provides</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Structural design detailing and fabrication drawing support</li>
            <li>Steel structure fabrication for agricultural buildings</li>
            <li>Steel beams, columns, trusses and framing components</li>
            <li>Roof and wall enclosure system supply (metal sheet, sandwich panel)</li>
            <li>Ventilation opening and ridge vent structural provisions</li>
            <li>Corrosion-resistant surface treatment (painting, galvanizing)</li>
            <li>Component marking, packing and container loading</li>
            <li>Export documentation support and logistics coordination</li>
            <li>Overseas installation technical guidance</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
