          <h4>ZhongSai Does Not Directly Provide</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>Poultry / livestock equipment (feeding, watering, climate control)</li>
            <li>Animal husbandry consulting or production management</li>
            <li>Local construction or erection at project site</li>
            <li>Local foundation construction</li>
            <li>Local general contracting / EPC</li>
            <li>Manure management system design or supply</li>
            <li>Customs brokerage as a licensed customs broker</li>
